'''Kubiluga''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 3.4 Update|Version 3.4]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Tales of the Nekoluga (Gacha Event)|Tales of the Nekoluga]] and [[METAL BUSTERS (Gacha Event)|METAL BUSTERS]] gacha events. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 6.6 Update|Version 6.6]] grants the ability to perform [[Critical Hit]]s, but can no longer knockback enemies. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 13.3 Update|Version 13.3]].

